{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>香港高爾夫球公開賽於粉嶺展開，兩位香港球手並列第五，許龍一首回合成績一般。</p><p></p><p></p><p>許龍一有四個洞造出低一桿的「小鳥」，但三個洞超標，成績是低1桿的69，與20位球手並列61位。隊友張雄熙及林日曦，則以低6桿並列第五，落後榜首2桿。</p><p></p><p>另一香港球手沈弘毅，以低4桿的66，並列21位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:02:17.199076+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T12:17:49.537737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:57:49.299915+00:00","content_hash":"6e29c164e28bd2ccc80419fc3227f2024b5d21deb1a175665c218386abd315ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}